\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul>\t<li><strong>Model Name :&nbsp;CL-32L50N LED TV<\/strong><\/li>\t<li>Series :&nbsp;CL-32L50N LED TV<\/li>\t<li>Cloud Tv : Yes<\/li>\t<li>HDMI : 3<\/li>\t<li>USB : 2<\/li>\t<li>Build In Wifi : Yes<\/li>\t<li>Launch Year : 2024<\/li>\t<li>Wall Mount Included : Yes<\/li><\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul>\t<li><strong>Audio Features :<\/strong><\/li>\t<li>No. of Speakers : 2<\/li>\t<li>Sound Technology :&nbsp;Turbo&nbsp; sound, Base reflex Speakers, Built in Box Woofer<\/li>\t<li>Surround Sound : Yes<\/li>\t<li>Speaker Output RMS : 24&nbsp;W<\/li>\t<li>Sound Mode : Standard, Music, User<\/li>\t<li>Supported&nbsp; Audio Formats : MP3,AAC,MP2, PCM<\/li><\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul>\t<li><strong>SMART TV Features :<\/strong><\/li>\t<li>Supported App – Netflix : Yes<\/li>\t<li>Supported App – Youtube&nbsp; :&nbsp;Yes<\/li>\t<li>Supported App – Disney + Hotstar : YES<\/li>\t<li>Supported App – Prime Video&nbsp; : YES<\/li>\t<li>Supported Mobile Operating System :&nbsp;YES<\/li>\t<li>Screen Mirroring : yes<\/li>\t<li>Bluetooth : yes<\/li>\t<li>Built in Wifi : yes<\/li>\t<li>Ethernet : 1<\/li>\t<li>Other Internet Features : BROWSER<\/li><\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul>\t<li><strong>Connectivity Feature :<\/strong><\/li>\t<li>HDMI : 3 rear<\/li>\t<li>USB : 2 rear<\/li>\t<li>PC D- sub : Yes<\/li>\t<li>Headphone Jack : Yes<\/li>\t<li>Audio Output : Optical, ARC, Headphone Out<\/li><\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\/p><ul>\t<li><strong>Remote Control Features :<\/strong><\/li>\t<li>Smart Remote : YES<\/li>\t<li>Color Screen : Yes<\/li><\/ul><\/p>"},"comp-m1stdngn_r_comp-lrhxc1ok":{"deleted":true,"content":{}},"comp-m1stdngn_r_comp-lgj6iu7y_r_comp-leyenube1":{"deleted":true}},{"comp-m1stdngn_r_comp-l5i2hu46":{"wixSDKItems":[{"src":"wix:image:\/\/v1\/fbffc6_dcc1026e2a674acea9d32a2d6d5ffb41~mv2.jpg\/FRONT WITH FEATURES.jpg#originWidth=10000&originHeight=10000","title":"","alt":"","type":"Image"},{"src":"wix:image:\/\/v1\/fbffc6_fc7b033a6ef7443e8168c12b0647f8d1~mv2.jpg\/SIDE BACK ANGLE 1.jpg#originWi